# Every pull request gets a review request automatically, so nothing sits waiting
# for someone to notice it. Ownership here is about routing, not permission.
#
# Last match wins, so the specific rules below override the catch-all.

* @aaroncoville

# Release, signing and CI plumbing. Breaking these breaks shipping for everyone.
/.github/workflows/    @aaroncoville
/electron-builder.yml  @aaroncoville
/RELEASE.md            @aaroncoville
/RELEASE-CHECKLIST.md  @aaroncoville

# Licensing and attribution. Changes here have legal weight.
/LICENSE                                  @aaroncoville
/src/renderer/src/assets/ATTRIBUTION.md    @aaroncoville

# Security and privacy surface.
/SECURITY.md   @aaroncoville
/TELEMETRY.md  @aaroncoville

# Public credit for contributors. Adding a name here is a public claim about someone's work.
/.github/contributors-extra.json  @aaroncoville
/CONTRIBUTORS.md                  @aaroncoville
